 ('What does the concept of qadar (destiny) generally express?', 'God’s knowing and decreeing what has been and will be', ['Chance becoming a god', 'A person knowing the future for certain', 'Ignoring human will entirely'], 'Qadar is God’s knowing and decreeing all things by His knowledge.', 'Destiny and decree'),
