 ('In terms of belief in destiny, what is the right conduct in illness?', 'Seeking treatment and trusting in God', ['Rejecting treatment outright', 'Blaming others for the illness', 'Regarding precaution as shirk'], 'Seeking treatment is not contrary to belief in destiny; healing is from God.', 'Destiny and decree'),
