 ('Where does Ya-Sin 12 say everything is enumerated and recorded?', 'In a clear record (imam mubin)', ['In the wind', 'In the sea', 'In the sky'], 'Ya-Sin 12 says everything is enumerated in a clear record (imam mubin).', 'Destiny and decree'),
