 ('In belief in destiny, God knows human acts beforehand; does this knowledge compel people?', 'No; knowledge does not compel', ['Yes; people are compelled', 'God does not know', 'People cannot act at all'], 'God’s foreknowledge does not coerce; people do the act by their choice.', 'Destiny and decree'),
 ('According to al-A‘raf 34, what happens when a community’s term arrives?', 'It is neither delayed nor advanced by an hour', ['It is postponed', 'It is shortened', 'It is forgotten'], 'Al-A‘raf 34 says when the term comes, it is neither delayed nor advanced even by an hour.', 'Destiny and decree'),
